  "title": "Platforms Manager Skills",
  "summary": "Platform Manager Skills is a course that focuses on developing the skills of moderators and speakers specializing in cultural events. From preparations to body language, this course explores your potential in public speaking and presentation skills. The course also includes real-life scenarios for the participants to train with and present in front of the other participants. Course objectives: Applying real-life scenarios and how participants can deal with them. Present different real-life examples of good and bad platform management. Explore tools and techniques to help participants research better and prepare more professionally for any session Allow participants to share their experiences",
